  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Outside the office, Toshi pulls up in a bargain van bought cheap and introduces two brand-new recruits to Muranishi: a young cinema dreamer and a burly former amateur rugby player, whom Muranishi promptly gives an easy-to-remember sport nickname. Listen to the Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "おっさん、いい車だろ？安く買い上げたんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "今日からうちで兵隊になる二人だ。はい、挨拶。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "あっ、三田村です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どうしてうちに？うちはアダルトのメーカーだけど。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "まあまあ、細かいことは気にすんなよ。ここのおっきいのが後藤だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "後藤です。社会人ラグビーでバックスやってました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "じゃあ、あだ名はラグビーでいいか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "ラグビーでいいですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ああ、覚えやすいし呼びやすいよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "それでお願いします！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "よし、じゃあさっさと乗れ。行くぞ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ここに来る前は何やってたの？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "おっさん、いい車だろ？安く買い上げたんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Old man, nice ride, isn't it? I bought it dirt cheap.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "今日からうちで兵隊になる二人だ。はい、挨拶。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'These two are joining us as foot soldiers starting today. Go on, say hello.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "あっ、三田村です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, I'm Mitamura!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どうしてうちに？うちはアダルトのメーカーだけど。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why join our place? You know we're an adult video studio, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "まあまあ、細かいことは気にすんなよ。ここのおっきいのが後藤だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now, now, don't sweat the small details! The big guy here is Goto.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "後藤です。社会人ラグビーでバックスやってました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm Goto. I played in the backs in corporate amateur rugby.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "じゃあ、あだ名はラグビーでいいか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright then, how about we nickname you Rugby?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "ラグビーでいいですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Rugby is okay with you, sir?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ああ、覚えやすいし呼びやすいよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yeah, it's easy to remember and easy to call out.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "それでお願いします！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please call me that, sir!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "よし、じゃあさっさと乗れ。行くぞ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, hurry up and hop in! Let's roll!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ここに来る前は何やってたの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What were you doing right before coming here?'",
      "gap": 0.65
